{"product_id":"hooray-for-the-holidays-multi-rom","title":"HOORAY FOR THE HOLIDAYS + MULTI-ROM","description":"\u003cp\u003eJack is on his summer holidays. He's at the seaside with his grandma and grandad. Alfie is Jack's dog. He's on holiday too! Follow Jack and Alfie in their fun adventures at the beach. In this Reader you will find: Games and language activities | An audio recording of the story | A picture dictionary Tags At the seaside | Free time Jack is on his summer holidays. He's at the seaside with his grandma and grandad. Alfie is Jack's dog. He's on holiday too! Follow Jack and Alfie in their fun adventures at the beach. The Multi-ROM CD that accompanies the Young ELI Readers adds a new, digital dimension to reading in class with an interactive whiteboard (IWB), to reading in the school multimedia centre or to reading at home on the PC. The Multi-ROM CD allows children to: follow fun animations of the story; listen to the recordings on either a conventional CD player or a PC; do engaging, interactive and auto-correcting exercises.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 210 x 234\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Dominique Guillemant\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9788853606181\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 32\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45472787136665,"sku":"7RC9788853606181","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/684ff81b1cb6f_HOORAY_FOR_THE_HOLIDAYS___MULTI-ROM_Dominique_Guillemant.jpg?v=1752084382","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/hooray-for-the-holidays-multi-rom","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}